WEBVTT

01:50.229 --> 01:53.920
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.229 --> 01:56.800
[Episode 17]

02:09.590 --> 02:10.240
Mr. Xiao,

02:10.520 --> 02:11.850
I'm leaving for the day.

02:13.090 --> 02:13.810
Hold on.

02:15.630 --> 02:16.430
Hasn't Hu Xiu

02:16.430 --> 02:18.470
finished inspecting
the construction site yet?

02:18.470 --> 02:19.750
I just called to check.

02:19.750 --> 02:21.240
She said the inspection's done,

02:21.240 --> 02:23.800
but she needs to make a run to Forma
with Mr. Pei

02:24.360 --> 02:25.660
to pick up some supplier materials,

02:25.660 --> 02:27.920
so she won't be coming back to the studio.

02:29.430 --> 02:29.960
Alright.

02:30.020 --> 02:30.550
Alright.

02:39.360 --> 02:41.310
The steel and sand-and-gravel suppliers

02:41.310 --> 02:42.280
are both reputable,
long-established manufacturers,

02:42.280 --> 02:43.470
so there shouldn't be any issues.

02:43.470 --> 02:45.430
As for the other suppliers and studios,

02:45.430 --> 02:46.310
we'll discuss things internally first

02:46.310 --> 02:48.110
and then get back to you, Mr. Pei.

02:50.630 --> 02:51.900
It's already this hour.

02:51.900 --> 02:53.829
Why don't we have dinner together?

02:54.520 --> 02:56.079
I don't want to impose.

02:57.680 --> 02:58.810
It's just staff meal.

02:58.810 --> 03:00.870
You don't need to be so formal, Ms. Hu.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.030
Besides,

03:02.190 --> 03:04.030
our partner has come all this way.

03:04.030 --> 03:05.560
If we can't even offer a meal,

03:05.560 --> 03:06.590
word might get out

03:06.590 --> 03:08.120
and make Forma look stingy.

03:09.280 --> 03:09.870
Let's go.

03:10.150 --> 03:11.280
I'll show you around

03:11.280 --> 03:12.590
Forma's staff cafeteria while we're at it.

03:12.590 --> 03:14.190
You'll be coming here often.

03:16.840 --> 03:17.430
Alright.

04:10.170 --> 04:10.870
So, what do you think?

04:10.870 --> 04:12.930
Regret not choosing Forma back then?

04:13.630 --> 04:14.400
Not at all.

04:14.680 --> 04:16.940
Being Forma's partner is quite nice too.

04:16.950 --> 04:19.079
Take more of whatever dishes you like.

04:29.950 --> 04:30.880
Are you home yet?

04:32.560 --> 04:33.240
Not yet.

04:37.190 --> 04:39.450
Still haven't finished the inspection?

04:43.120 --> 04:43.909
It's finished.

04:43.909 --> 04:45.640
Just getting ready for dinner.

04:49.510 --> 04:50.159
With whom?

04:53.510 --> 04:54.360
With Mr. Pei.

04:54.560 --> 04:55.510
Staff meal.

04:56.390 --> 04:56.920
But

04:56.920 --> 04:57.950
as far as I know,

04:58.150 --> 04:59.750
employees aren't obligated

04:59.800 --> 05:03.200
to report their after-work activities
to their boss, right?

05:09.520 --> 05:10.520
Your sketchbook

05:10.630 --> 05:12.160
has been packed into my box.

05:12.160 --> 05:12.920
Come get it.

05:19.040 --> 05:19.900
Done chatting?

05:20.240 --> 05:21.770
Is there something urgent?

05:22.120 --> 05:22.850
No, nothing.

05:23.630 --> 05:24.310
Try this.

05:24.480 --> 05:26.280
These are all signature dishes.

05:28.240 --> 05:29.840
Since you took it by mistake,

05:29.930 --> 05:31.470
shouldn't you be the one returning it?

05:31.470 --> 05:33.130
Why am I the one going to get it?

05:46.630 --> 05:48.270
Where exactly is it?

05:52.930 --> 05:53.490
Xiaorou,

05:53.560 --> 05:54.390
you're back.

05:54.800 --> 05:55.480
Listen,

05:55.620 --> 05:57.620
there's that dripping sound again.

06:01.270 --> 06:02.160
Got it.

06:02.950 --> 06:04.240
Let's call it a day.

06:05.240 --> 06:06.070
Okay.

06:14.740 --> 06:16.540
I'm leaving then, Xiaorou.

06:57.310 --> 06:58.360
Mr. Pei, please stop here.

06:58.360 --> 06:59.420
This is far enough.

06:59.670 --> 07:00.240
It's getting late.

07:00.240 --> 07:01.430
Let me drive you home.

07:01.430 --> 07:02.830
That won't be necessary.

07:04.360 --> 07:06.620
I'll see my own employee back, of course.

07:11.390 --> 07:12.270
Mr. Xiao?

07:13.310 --> 07:16.370
Mr. Xiao, are you also here
to visit Forma's cafeteria?

07:18.800 --> 07:20.460
I've brought this here to you.

07:23.000 --> 07:24.800
I didn't ask you to bring it here.

07:25.070 --> 07:26.670
I'll give it to you in the car.

07:29.600 --> 07:31.440
Why not let Ms. Hu choose for herself

07:31.440 --> 07:32.970
whose car she wants to take?

07:34.750 --> 07:36.240
Why force it, Mr. Xiao?

07:48.240 --> 07:49.000
Ms. Hu?

07:57.560 --> 07:58.790
Thank you for your hospitality today.

07:58.790 --> 08:00.020
I won't trouble you further, Mr. Pei.

08:00.020 --> 08:01.020
See you next time.

08:01.260 --> 08:01.870
Goodbye.

08:25.160 --> 08:27.020
Got the suppliers' information?

08:30.040 --> 08:30.840
It's all here.

08:32.870 --> 08:35.750
I've discussed and confirmed
the steel, cement,

08:35.750 --> 08:38.549
and sand-and-gravel manufacturers
with Mr. Pei.

08:39.020 --> 08:42.010
For glass and coatings,
Forma has two supplier options

08:42.010 --> 08:43.669
with some price differences.

08:43.720 --> 08:46.250
I've specified our technical requirements.

08:46.600 --> 08:47.320
As for the details,

08:47.320 --> 08:50.510
you can take a look at the materials
before making a decision.

08:50.510 --> 08:53.000
As for 3D-printed ceramic
building material supplier,

08:53.000 --> 08:54.340
there are even more options

08:54.340 --> 08:57.270
since the technology
is controlled by Forma itself.

09:02.750 --> 09:03.550
What's wrong?

09:06.270 --> 09:06.960
Mr. Xiao.

09:07.440 --> 09:09.300
I've finished reporting my work.

09:09.600 --> 09:11.400
Do you have any other questions?

09:13.320 --> 09:13.960
No.

09:14.440 --> 09:17.360
I'll make a decision
after reviewing the materials.

09:17.360 --> 09:19.160
If it wasn't so urgent, Mr. Xiao,

09:19.240 --> 09:21.240
why did you rush all the way to Forma?

09:27.580 --> 09:29.310
Are you upset

09:29.490 --> 09:31.350
because I had dinner with Mr. Pei?

09:33.030 --> 09:34.960
But we're partners with him now.

09:34.960 --> 09:37.890
I shouldn't really need to
avoid meeting him, right?

09:43.240 --> 09:44.500
Since you care so much,

09:44.850 --> 09:47.850
why don't you just
kick me out of the project, Mr. Xiao?

09:49.840 --> 09:51.650
You're doing well on this project.

09:51.650 --> 09:53.650
I have no reason to kick you out of it.

10:03.200 --> 10:04.030
Mr. Gong?

10:04.630 --> 10:05.760
Why is he calling me?

10:07.540 --> 10:08.780
What is it, Mr. Gong?

10:09.530 --> 10:10.150
Hu Xiu.

10:10.220 --> 10:11.750
You need to come right away.

10:25.720 --> 10:26.990
Mr. Gong, what's wrong?

10:26.990 --> 10:27.700
Follow me.

10:30.240 --> 10:31.670
Why is the café already closed?

10:31.670 --> 10:33.240
This isn't Zhao's usual closing time.

10:33.240 --> 10:33.840
Exactly.

10:33.840 --> 10:35.200
I was about to go home,

10:35.200 --> 10:35.790
but when I passed by

10:35.790 --> 10:36.320
and glanced over,

10:36.320 --> 10:37.030
I saw her...

10:38.030 --> 10:39.150
I'd never seen her
like that before, either.

10:39.150 --> 10:40.410
It really startled me.

10:44.270 --> 10:44.790
Look.

10:45.440 --> 10:46.700
She's still like this.

10:47.690 --> 10:49.410
She was already like this
when I passed by.

10:49.410 --> 10:51.150
Think about it, that was
quite a while ago.

10:51.150 --> 10:52.360
Even as someone who doesn't sell coffee,
I know

10:52.360 --> 10:54.460
that once the beans are ground,
you're supposed to drink it right away,

10:54.460 --> 10:56.630
otherwise the flavor disappears quickly.

10:56.630 --> 10:57.910
The café's already closed,

10:57.910 --> 10:59.970
so why is she grinding so much coffee?

11:00.310 --> 11:01.100
Could it be

11:02.590 --> 11:04.320
she's possessed or something?

11:12.410 --> 11:13.130
Zhao.

11:17.510 --> 11:18.870
Zhao, what happened?

11:23.840 --> 11:24.910
What happened?

11:28.550 --> 11:29.150
Zhao.

11:30.240 --> 11:31.320
No matter what happened,

11:31.320 --> 11:32.720
you can tell me.

11:33.150 --> 11:33.720
It's okay.

11:33.720 --> 11:35.050
I'm always here for you.

11:38.910 --> 11:39.510
Stop grinding it.

11:39.510 --> 11:40.510
Talk to me.

11:41.910 --> 11:43.390
Stop grinding it, alright?

11:43.390 --> 11:44.080
Zhao,

11:44.510 --> 11:45.240
stop it.

11:59.080 --> 12:00.140
Wang Guangming...

12:05.080 --> 12:06.210
Is having an affair.

12:25.390 --> 12:26.120
Does it hurt?

12:40.240 --> 12:40.960
Honey,

12:41.510 --> 12:42.910
are you still at the café?

12:43.200 --> 12:44.530
It's already this hour.

12:44.750 --> 12:45.950
I'll come pick you up.

12:46.650 --> 12:47.850
Reply for me, please.

12:49.790 --> 12:51.450
I don't know what to say to him.

12:53.480 --> 12:54.550
Just tell him

12:55.670 --> 12:57.130
I'm staying with you today

12:57.390 --> 12:58.450
and not going home.

13:16.030 --> 13:16.720
Zhao,

13:17.480 --> 13:18.840
whatever decision you make,

13:18.840 --> 13:19.840
I'll be with you.

13:22.850 --> 13:24.460
Then right now, I just want to

13:28.850 --> 13:29.850
sleep for a bit.

13:31.720 --> 13:32.600
I'm tired.

13:34.320 --> 13:35.380
Alright, go to bed.

14:39.130 --> 14:42.760
♪ Midnight ♪

14:43.770 --> 14:48.830
♪ I see stars fly ♪

14:50.440 --> 14:56.090
♪ As they fall to Earth ♪

14:55.510 --> 14:56.360
It's so late.

14:56.610 --> 15:04.010
♪ Lighting up this moment ♪

14:56.670 --> 14:58.330
Why haven't you gone home yet?

15:01.080 --> 15:02.480
I was worried you might need something,

15:02.480 --> 15:03.610
so I waited for a bit.

15:04.690 --> 15:07.010
♪ You outshine the stars ♪

15:07.530 --> 15:10.260
♪ And hold them in your palm ♪

15:10.700 --> 15:13.730
♪ Now we've made a way ♪

15:13.750 --> 15:14.560
What's wrong?

15:14.340 --> 15:17.760
♪ Now we're at the edge ♪

15:17.780 --> 15:19.780
♪ Tomorrow and today ♪

15:18.240 --> 15:19.770
It's because she didn't cry

15:20.270 --> 15:22.150
that I feel even more heartbroken for her.

15:20.650 --> 15:23.260
♪ Now in every way ♪

15:23.280 --> 15:28.370
♪ The world draws still ♪

15:28.860 --> 15:33.260
♪ I wish for you ♪

15:34.910 --> 15:40.440
♪ I wish for you ♪

15:40.950 --> 15:47.440
♪ Look up at the moon
and reach for my hand ♪

15:47.460 --> 15:51.250
♪ Oh I wish for you ♪

15:54.450 --> 15:58.850
♪ I wish for you ♪

16:00.500 --> 16:06.030
♪ I wish for you ♪

16:06.540 --> 16:13.030
♪ Look up at the moon
and reach for my hand ♪

16:12.810 --> 16:14.020
Iced Americano, please.

16:13.050 --> 16:16.840
♪ Oh I wish for you ♪

16:14.750 --> 16:16.210
Please wait here for a bit.

16:29.710 --> 16:30.710
Hu Xiu isn't here.

16:31.480 --> 16:32.600
She went home early in the morning
to change clothes.

16:32.600 --> 16:33.860
Said she had a meeting.

16:35.480 --> 16:36.120
I see.

16:37.840 --> 16:38.360
Thanks.

16:39.870 --> 16:40.480
Mr. Xiao.

16:47.120 --> 16:48.030
Even though I don't know

16:48.030 --> 16:49.020
what exactly happened

16:49.020 --> 16:50.850
between you and Xiu,

16:51.440 --> 16:52.670
I know her well.

16:52.800 --> 16:55.480
She may seem fine on the surface lately,

16:56.540 --> 16:58.360
but actually, when you moved out,

16:58.360 --> 17:00.420
she couldn't even enjoy the New Year.

17:01.030 --> 17:01.910
Xiu

17:02.140 --> 17:04.160
has always been very sincere and serious
with people

17:04.160 --> 17:05.819
and with everything she does.

17:06.720 --> 17:08.790
Maybe you should try

17:09.030 --> 17:10.829
being a bit more honest with her.

17:24.130 --> 17:24.859
Hello, Zhao.

17:25.109 --> 17:26.030
I bought you breakfast.

17:26.030 --> 17:26.720
It's on the table.

17:26.720 --> 17:28.180
Try to eat at least a little

17:28.400 --> 17:29.720
and get some proper rest.

17:29.720 --> 17:30.510
Don't worry.

17:30.680 --> 17:31.350
I'm okay.

17:32.000 --> 17:33.200
You didn't get to work late, did you?

17:33.200 --> 17:34.710
No, I timed it perfectly.

17:34.730 --> 17:36.180
I'm already at Forma now.

17:37.070 --> 17:37.880
I'll come find you at the café

17:37.880 --> 17:38.750
after I get off work.

17:38.750 --> 17:39.410
Bye-bye...

17:53.590 --> 17:54.320
Take it slow.

17:54.550 --> 17:55.610
We still have time.

17:56.480 --> 17:57.680
Thanks a lot, Mr. Pei.

17:59.510 --> 18:01.170
Didn't sleep well last night?

18:03.810 --> 18:04.340
Let's go.

18:20.960 --> 18:21.640
Mr. Xiao.

18:21.790 --> 18:22.510
Sun.

18:23.310 --> 18:24.640
Morning, Engineer Sun.

18:24.960 --> 18:25.550
Mr. Pei.

18:26.160 --> 18:27.000
Hu.

18:28.480 --> 18:28.960
I'm sorry

18:28.960 --> 18:29.820
for being late.

18:31.030 --> 18:32.350
If my watch is correct,

18:32.350 --> 18:33.270
we're not late.

18:33.270 --> 18:34.240
Right on time.

18:34.350 --> 18:35.000
Mr. Pei,

18:35.960 --> 18:37.890
although we're working together,

18:38.070 --> 18:39.310
you're from the engineering side

18:39.310 --> 18:41.170
and our studio is the design side.

18:41.270 --> 18:42.110
The way you used the word "we" just now

18:42.110 --> 18:44.110
wasn't really appropriate, was it?

18:45.160 --> 18:45.680
Sure.

18:46.050 --> 18:48.310
Everything you say is correct, Mr. Xiao.

18:50.510 --> 18:51.710
The elevator is here.

19:02.460 --> 19:04.860
Mr. Pei, which floor is
the meeting room on?

19:13.450 --> 19:14.100
Mr. Pei.

19:14.350 --> 19:16.900
Do you usually press the elevator button
for your employees too?

19:16.900 --> 19:17.900
Not really.

19:18.110 --> 19:19.590
Ms. Hu is the only exception.

19:19.590 --> 19:21.320
It's not the first time anyway.

19:22.240 --> 19:23.960
Ms. Hu, you might not remember.

19:23.960 --> 19:25.150
It was when you came to  Forma
for an interview

19:25.150 --> 19:27.680
and were taking the elevator down
afterward.

19:36.640 --> 19:39.100
So you were that person
in the elevator that day.

19:39.100 --> 19:40.830
Sorry, I didn't really notice.

19:41.280 --> 19:42.080
It's alright.

19:42.200 --> 19:43.440
It's just a pity

19:43.510 --> 19:46.070
that you didn't choose Forma
in the end, Ms. Hu.

19:46.070 --> 19:47.660
But aren't you working together now
anyway?

19:47.660 --> 19:50.590
That shows Mr. Pei and Hu
were meant to cross paths...

19:53.520 --> 19:55.200
It only shows Forma failed to
recognize talent

19:55.200 --> 19:56.460
and couldn't keep her.

19:57.350 --> 19:59.550
All I can say is that
Ms. Hu is very outstanding—

19:59.550 --> 20:02.350
she ended up becoming a partner
of Forma after all.

20:20.720 --> 20:21.320
Thank you.

20:30.150 --> 20:30.970
This helps replenish
your energy and blood.

20:30.970 --> 20:32.500
It's the healthier option.

20:33.540 --> 20:34.300
Thank you.

20:49.270 --> 20:50.240
I'll begin now.

20:51.200 --> 20:53.640
The suppliers provided by Mr. Pei cover
a very comprehensive range of categories.

20:53.640 --> 20:56.480
This is the shortlist our studio
put together after an initial evaluation.

20:56.480 --> 20:58.680
For steel, cement, and sand and gravel,

20:58.880 --> 21:00.550
as I discussed with Mr. Pei yesterday,

21:00.550 --> 21:03.400
we'll go with state-owned enterprises
with absolute quality guarantees.

21:03.400 --> 21:05.070
Taking all factors into account,

21:05.070 --> 21:07.480
I've compiled a shortlist of manufacturers

21:07.480 --> 21:08.880
as reference recommendations.

21:08.880 --> 21:11.110
For waterproofing
and insulation materials,

21:11.110 --> 21:12.510
we recommend Shunke Chemical;

21:12.510 --> 21:13.310
and for timber,

21:13.310 --> 21:14.960
Qisheng Timber.

21:14.980 --> 21:16.580
Excuse me, let me interrupt.

21:17.040 --> 21:19.160
I see that Qisheng's quotation
is relatively high.

21:19.160 --> 21:20.820
Why do you recommend Qisheng?

21:21.550 --> 21:23.030
Because timber has
relatively high requirements

21:23.030 --> 21:24.640
for temperature and moisture,

21:24.640 --> 21:26.190
the shorter the transportation distance,

21:26.190 --> 21:28.060
the lower the transport costs.

21:28.440 --> 21:30.160
Qisheng's factory

21:30.160 --> 21:31.310
is very close to Shanghai,

21:31.310 --> 21:32.920
so the transportation losses are minimal.

21:32.920 --> 21:33.790
When you factor everything in,

21:33.790 --> 21:37.450
their overall cost actually ends up lower
than other factories'.

21:37.680 --> 21:39.940
Do you have any other questions, Mr. Pei?

21:40.830 --> 21:43.290
Your analysis is very professional,
Ms. Hu.

21:44.480 --> 21:46.160
As for decorative stonework,

21:46.160 --> 21:47.880
we recommend Mingzhu Building Materials,

21:47.880 --> 21:49.720
because their product range
is very comprehensive,

21:49.720 --> 21:50.590
and their colors and textures

21:50.590 --> 21:53.390
can better reproduce
the intended design effect.

21:53.640 --> 21:56.370
Ms. Hu's analysis is indeed
very comprehensive.

22:01.310 --> 22:03.840
Do you have any
different opinions, Mr. Xiao?

22:03.880 --> 22:05.790
I think we have better options.

22:06.270 --> 22:07.820
So which supplier do you prefer, Mr. Xiao?

22:07.820 --> 22:09.680
You might as well say it outright.

22:12.030 --> 22:13.160
At the end of last year,

22:13.160 --> 22:15.400
Forma took on a hot spring hotel project

22:15.590 --> 22:16.510
and used materials

22:16.510 --> 22:18.030
supplied by Jiahao Stone.

22:18.440 --> 22:20.520
For the library project
the year before that,

22:20.520 --> 22:22.670
the timber supplier was
China Resources Industrial.

22:22.670 --> 22:24.640
And the amusement park project
from some time ago—

22:24.640 --> 22:25.880
although it wasn't publicly announced—

22:25.880 --> 22:27.780
I recall the supplier was Fenghe,

22:27.800 --> 22:28.400
right?

22:29.470 --> 22:31.330
What do you mean by that, Mr. Xiao?

22:31.680 --> 22:32.680
What I mean is

22:32.880 --> 22:35.420
that this set of supplier information
is incomplete.

22:35.420 --> 22:37.870
I need the full list of Forma's
partner manufacturers

22:37.870 --> 22:41.000
before I can give
the most appropriate recommendation.

22:43.590 --> 22:45.600
Forma works with a number of suppliers

22:45.600 --> 22:47.200
and we update them frequently.

22:47.200 --> 22:49.000
It's difficult to list them all.

22:49.000 --> 22:50.400
But we can guarantee that

22:50.400 --> 22:51.790
for the Lyman project,

22:51.830 --> 22:53.240
only the best ones will be used.

22:53.240 --> 22:54.900
Since we're working together,

22:54.900 --> 22:57.160
I'd still like to take all suppliers
into consideration

22:57.160 --> 22:58.890
and select the optimal option.

23:01.920 --> 23:02.510
Alright.

23:03.430 --> 23:05.300
Since you've requested it, Mr. Xiao,

23:05.300 --> 23:06.970
Forma will recheck everything

23:06.970 --> 23:09.770
and prepare a complete set
of supplier materials.

23:10.240 --> 23:11.040
Alright then.

23:11.310 --> 23:13.830
We'll wait until
Mr. Pei has all the materials ready,

23:13.830 --> 23:16.090
and we can discuss it further afterward.

23:38.030 --> 23:38.590
Xiaorou.

23:38.850 --> 23:40.480
Why did you grind so much coffee?

23:40.480 --> 23:42.210
Do we have a big order coming in?

23:42.620 --> 23:43.150
Xiaorou?

23:48.790 --> 23:49.590
What's wrong?

23:50.410 --> 23:51.170
Nothing.

24:01.220 --> 24:03.230
[Honey, let's have dinner together
tonight. I've got good news to share.]

24:05.640 --> 24:06.160
Xiaorou,

24:06.160 --> 24:07.230
the pipe has burst.

24:17.340 --> 24:19.100
What happened now?

24:26.730 --> 24:27.660
Oh my.

24:28.000 --> 24:28.550
This...

24:31.130 --> 24:31.850
Ms. Zhao,

24:31.880 --> 24:34.250
where are your water meter
and main switch?

24:34.250 --> 24:35.070
Upstairs.

24:42.870 --> 24:43.910
Are you here yet?

24:47.870 --> 24:48.970
Boss, what are your orders?

24:48.970 --> 24:49.890
Quick, come in.

24:51.480 --> 24:52.240
You and Fei,

24:52.350 --> 24:53.030
go over there

24:53.030 --> 24:54.990
and move all the furniture upstairs.

24:54.990 --> 24:55.680
Hurry up, you two!

24:55.680 --> 24:57.340
Mop up all the water over here.

24:57.720 --> 24:59.590
Remember to turn on
the air conditioner's heating

24:59.590 --> 25:00.070
and let it run for a couple of days
to dry things out.

25:00.070 --> 25:00.720
Otherwise, all these

25:00.720 --> 25:01.510
wooden floors and wooden furniture

25:01.510 --> 25:02.310
will be ruined.

25:02.310 --> 25:02.910
Got it.

25:03.000 --> 25:03.590
Ms. Zhao,

25:03.720 --> 25:05.710
I've contacted the industrial park's
property management.

25:05.710 --> 25:07.380
The repair technician
will contact you directly.

25:07.380 --> 25:08.880
You should close the café for today.

25:08.880 --> 25:09.750
Thank you.

25:10.480 --> 25:11.060
No problem.

25:11.060 --> 25:13.990
Just think about how you'll thank me
properly later.

25:14.950 --> 25:16.550
Fei, you can't do it that way.

25:47.200 --> 25:47.880
Ms. Zhao.

25:47.980 --> 25:49.240
Everything's mostly cleaned up.

25:49.240 --> 25:49.880
Well...

25:58.460 --> 25:59.090
Ms. Zhao.

26:04.090 --> 26:04.610
Are...

26:05.920 --> 26:06.990
Are you okay?

26:07.900 --> 26:09.770
I was too careless.

26:12.240 --> 26:13.550
A long time ago,

26:15.350 --> 26:17.030
my assistant mentioned to me

26:18.280 --> 26:20.680
that there was a dripping sound
in the café,

26:22.880 --> 26:24.680
but I didn‘t pay much attention.

26:26.880 --> 26:27.720
Later,

26:28.240 --> 26:30.240
the dripping became more frequent,

26:32.640 --> 26:33.900
and I could hear it too,

26:37.440 --> 26:39.840
but I didn't think
it was anything serious.

26:41.880 --> 26:43.240
And today,

26:44.750 --> 26:46.080
the pipe finally burst.

26:52.550 --> 26:53.480
In fact,

26:55.440 --> 26:57.440
the cracks had been there all along,

26:58.180 --> 26:59.980
and the warnings had been given.

27:02.550 --> 27:04.480
I just failed to notice them.

27:12.720 --> 27:14.030
It's understandable

27:14.750 --> 27:16.080
that you didn't pay much attention

27:16.080 --> 27:17.190
to such a small matter.

27:17.190 --> 27:18.060
Besides,

27:18.290 --> 27:20.820
it's not too late
now that you've realized it.

27:21.160 --> 27:22.240
If it really can't be fixed,

27:22.240 --> 27:23.170
just replace it—

27:23.270 --> 27:24.200
no big deal.

27:35.160 --> 27:35.750
Right.

27:36.960 --> 27:38.270
It wasn't a big deal.

27:39.680 --> 27:41.280
I just didn't pay attention.

27:45.880 --> 27:47.080
Stop squatting here.

27:47.390 --> 27:48.350
Hurry and go change your clothes.

27:48.350 --> 27:49.410
Don't catch a cold.

27:56.680 --> 27:57.270
Okay.

28:00.120 --> 28:00.650
These...

28:00.670 --> 28:02.960
These shoes of yours can't get wet,
can they?

28:02.960 --> 28:04.290
They're all soaked now.

28:04.960 --> 28:06.140
Let me compensate you for them.

28:06.140 --> 28:06.820
No need.

28:07.140 --> 28:08.480
These are just old shoes anyway.

28:08.480 --> 28:10.480
Besides, we are neighbors.

28:10.830 --> 28:12.030
Don't worry about it.

28:14.070 --> 28:15.920
It's really nice to be rich.

28:16.350 --> 28:17.640
He just bought those shoes
the day before yesterday,

28:17.640 --> 28:18.970
and now, they're "old."

28:56.960 --> 28:57.640
Okay.

28:59.000 --> 29:00.660
Let's meet at the usual place.

29:05.700 --> 29:06.260
Mr. Xiao.

29:06.550 --> 29:07.980
Xiaohe and the others went to get the car.

29:07.980 --> 29:10.040
We can just meet them at the entrance.

29:10.550 --> 29:11.160
Mr. Pei.

29:11.270 --> 29:12.440
Please stop here.

29:12.550 --> 29:13.350
Once the materials arrive,

29:13.350 --> 29:14.760
I'll coordinate the timing with you.

29:14.760 --> 29:16.690
Also, thank you for the jujube tea.

29:17.240 --> 29:18.440
You look much more energetic now.

29:18.440 --> 29:20.440
Get some good rest when you get back.

29:21.030 --> 29:21.680
Mr. Xiao.

29:24.200 --> 29:26.350
There will be plenty of work interactions
going forward.

29:26.350 --> 29:28.270
I don't have to report
every single contact

29:28.270 --> 29:30.070
between Ms. Hu and me to you, do I?

29:30.640 --> 29:32.370
Being so controlling as a boss,

29:32.460 --> 29:35.520
be careful—you might end up
losing your employees too.

29:35.830 --> 29:37.790
Although Mr. Xiao
proposed a new plan today,

29:37.790 --> 29:39.110
it doesn't take away from the fact

29:39.110 --> 29:40.240
that Ms. Hu was well-prepared.

29:40.240 --> 29:42.030
Your presentation today
was very substantial.

29:42.030 --> 29:42.720
I believe

29:42.760 --> 29:45.000
our cooperation will be very pleasant.

29:45.790 --> 29:46.680
Thank you for your recognition.

29:46.680 --> 29:47.430
Goodbye, Mr. Pei.

29:47.430 --> 29:48.030
Take care.

29:54.960 --> 29:56.020
By the way, Mr. Pei.

29:56.830 --> 29:59.160
Let me answer your question from earlier.

29:59.830 --> 30:02.210
From now on, any contact you have
with Hu Xiu

30:02.210 --> 30:03.470
must be reported to me.

30:04.540 --> 30:04.980
Also,

30:05.510 --> 30:08.040
could you please
vary your poaching tactics?

30:08.790 --> 30:10.510
Apart from expressing slight regret,

30:10.510 --> 30:12.170
don't you have any new tricks?

30:14.030 --> 30:14.710
How about

30:15.390 --> 30:17.320
I sign you up for a training course?

30:17.440 --> 30:18.770
I'll cover the tuition.

30:35.590 --> 30:36.160
Xiu.

30:36.350 --> 30:38.150
No need to come to the café today.

30:38.200 --> 30:39.470
I want some time alone.

30:39.790 --> 30:40.350
Okay.

30:40.550 --> 30:42.350
Let me know if you need anything.

30:49.350 --> 30:50.950
In the meeting just now, I...

30:51.840 --> 30:52.250
Mr. Xiao.

30:52.250 --> 30:53.050
What was that?

30:53.200 --> 30:54.530
What about the meeting?

30:55.030 --> 30:55.590
Nothing.

31:10.400 --> 31:11.000
Xiaohe,

31:11.270 --> 31:13.110
let's not go back to the office yet.

31:13.110 --> 31:14.040
To Lanjing Park.

31:24.340 --> 31:25.100
Get off.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.800
No need to bring your laptop.

31:38.070 --> 31:39.330
What are we doing here?

31:41.160 --> 31:42.790
This is a new project we're working on.

31:42.790 --> 31:43.940
There's a trendy pop-up store

31:43.940 --> 31:45.470
that contacted our studio.

31:45.550 --> 31:46.830
They want to build

31:46.830 --> 31:48.680
a themed structure in this park.

31:49.140 --> 31:50.240
The project isn't finalized yet,

31:50.240 --> 31:51.840
so we're just checking it out first,

31:51.840 --> 31:52.920
mainly to relax a bit.

31:52.920 --> 31:53.350
Right.

31:54.180 --> 31:55.680
Let's shoot more footage here.
When we get back,

31:55.680 --> 31:57.680
help me with the composition, will you?

31:57.680 --> 31:58.880
After our last site visit,

31:58.880 --> 32:00.920
I realized your aesthetic sense
is amazing.

32:00.920 --> 32:02.280
It's excellent, you know?

32:02.280 --> 32:03.480
Let's take lots of photos

32:03.480 --> 32:04.440
to put in the project proposal.

32:04.440 --> 32:04.920
-No problem.
-Do you have the proposal?

32:04.920 --> 32:05.750
Actually, it's not that urgent...

32:05.750 --> 32:06.110
Sure I do.

32:06.110 --> 32:07.170
I'll send it to you.

32:07.420 --> 32:09.270
Why didn't you send it to me earlier?

32:09.270 --> 32:11.000
There's also a famous attraction here

32:11.000 --> 32:11.920
called the Dark Corridor.

32:11.920 --> 32:12.790
If we have time later,

32:12.790 --> 32:13.510
we should check it out too.

32:13.510 --> 32:14.740
Maybe we can find inspiration from

32:14.740 --> 32:15.920
that designer. What's his name again?

32:15.920 --> 32:16.850
Let me think.

32:17.160 --> 32:18.920
His name is... That foreign designer...

32:18.920 --> 32:19.510
He even won an award

32:19.510 --> 32:21.000
for this design, you know?

32:30.960 --> 32:31.680
Come here!

32:32.610 --> 32:33.130
Coming.

32:34.750 --> 32:36.280
Sun, shoot from this angle.

32:36.840 --> 32:37.500
Shoot that.

32:39.080 --> 32:40.630
Check out this pic I just took.

32:40.630 --> 32:41.160
How is it?

32:41.210 --> 32:42.340
Not bad.

32:42.440 --> 32:42.920
Of course.

32:42.920 --> 32:43.270
Wait, wait.

32:43.270 --> 32:44.640
Y-Your focus was off.

32:45.110 --> 32:45.440
Was it?

32:45.440 --> 32:46.440
The focus should be on the foreground,

32:46.440 --> 32:48.310
but you focused on the background.

32:48.310 --> 32:49.550
Your focal length wasn't right.

32:49.550 --> 32:50.880
You need to select this.

32:51.550 --> 32:52.110
Oh, I see.

32:52.110 --> 32:53.230
The exposure is also clearer this way.

32:53.230 --> 32:53.830
Sun Yifei!

32:53.880 --> 32:54.350
Next time...

32:54.350 --> 32:55.550
Sun Yifei, come here.

32:57.590 --> 32:58.300
Go up a bit.

32:58.440 --> 33:01.160
You can capture the east side
of the project site there.

33:01.160 --> 33:01.760
Is that so?

33:06.600 --> 33:07.640
Is it here, Mr. Xiao?

33:07.640 --> 33:08.570
A little higher.

33:11.680 --> 33:12.810
Is it here, Mr. Xiao?

33:13.370 --> 33:14.480
A little higher.

33:18.400 --> 33:19.130
Come with me.

33:23.950 --> 33:26.410
I still can't see the project site
from here.

33:27.640 --> 33:28.300
Mr. Xiao...

33:42.600 --> 33:43.930
Just now in the meeting,

33:43.990 --> 33:46.720
I didn't mean to say
your supplier choice was bad.

33:50.510 --> 33:51.590
It's my fault.

33:51.790 --> 33:52.590
I didn't check

33:52.590 --> 33:55.050
Forma's previous collaboration projects.

33:56.200 --> 33:58.860
Is this what you wanted to say in the car
just now?

34:01.200 --> 34:01.810
So

34:01.830 --> 34:03.780
we didn't come to the park for work?

34:05.750 --> 34:07.410
I was worried about your mood.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.480
Mr. Xiao.

34:11.960 --> 34:14.150
I won't get carried away just because

34:14.150 --> 34:15.610
a competitor flatters me,

34:15.710 --> 34:18.040
nor will I hold a grudge
simply because my boss

34:18.040 --> 34:19.070
points out my mistakes.

34:19.070 --> 34:20.469
You're overthinking it.

34:26.630 --> 34:27.480
I'm just

34:27.590 --> 34:28.989
a bit worried about Zhao.

34:35.800 --> 34:37.440
If you're really concerned,

34:38.150 --> 34:39.540
I can drive you to the café later

34:39.540 --> 34:41.000
and give you half a day off.

34:41.280 --> 34:41.840
No need.

34:42.000 --> 34:44.260
She said she wants some time alone today.

34:44.960 --> 34:45.840
She's an adult.

34:47.320 --> 34:48.030
I think

34:48.199 --> 34:49.730
she knows what she's doing.

34:52.320 --> 34:53.650
She's the type of person

34:53.670 --> 34:54.550
who's strong-willed

34:54.550 --> 34:55.320
and brave.

34:56.000 --> 34:58.360
She always says with love,
even water is filling;

34:58.360 --> 34:59.960
and with love comes ability.

35:01.590 --> 35:02.920
I thought she had finally met someone

35:02.920 --> 35:04.850
who wouldn't let down her courage.

35:05.960 --> 35:06.840
But now I see

35:07.920 --> 35:09.120
she deserves better.

35:10.840 --> 35:12.360
Of course, I'm no better

35:12.360 --> 35:13.760
in this regard myself—

35:14.720 --> 35:16.180
just about the same as her.

35:19.510 --> 35:20.910
I wonder how long it takes

35:21.130 --> 35:23.190
to truly see someone for who they are.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.620
I'll go buy some water.

36:04.960 --> 36:05.800
There's also

36:05.800 --> 36:08.150
a famous attraction here
called Dark Corridor.

36:08.150 --> 36:09.360
We should check it out later
if we have time.

36:09.360 --> 36:09.880
Here in this park?

36:09.880 --> 36:10.440
Yes.

36:10.800 --> 36:11.630
When we go there,

36:11.630 --> 36:13.030
we can look for project inspiration,

36:13.030 --> 36:13.510
right?

36:21.230 --> 36:22.000
Hu Xiu?

36:33.690 --> 36:36.110
[Please touch the wall with your left hand
and bravely move forward]

36:36.690 --> 36:39.110
[through the darkness, until you reach
the realm of love and light.]

36:43.510 --> 36:44.280
Hu Xiu?

37:26.150 --> 37:26.880
Xiaoyi.

37:27.230 --> 37:28.490
Put your blindfold on,

37:28.880 --> 37:29.670
count to ten,

37:30.000 --> 37:31.030
and then come find Daddy,

37:31.030 --> 37:31.670
okay?

37:32.030 --> 37:32.710
Okay.

37:38.630 --> 37:39.510
Ten.

37:40.320 --> 37:41.000
Nine.

37:41.760 --> 37:42.400
Eight.

37:43.360 --> 37:43.960
Seven.

37:44.840 --> 37:45.320
One!

37:46.230 --> 37:46.920
Dad?

37:48.320 --> 37:49.030
Dad?

37:50.550 --> 37:51.320
Dad?

37:52.760 --> 37:53.480
Dad?

37:56.930 --> 37:57.560
Dad?

37:58.480 --> 37:59.190
Dad?

38:00.150 --> 38:00.840
Dad?

38:01.920 --> 38:02.590
Dad?

38:30.320 --> 38:31.110
Xiao Zhiyu.

38:33.510 --> 38:34.320
Xiao Zhiyu.

39:22.590 --> 39:23.440
Xiao Zhiyu.

39:26.530 --> 39:27.490
Are you alright?

39:44.760 --> 39:45.590
Xiao Zhiyu.

39:46.000 --> 39:47.000
Are you alright?

39:49.470 --> 39:50.030
I'm fine.

39:52.030 --> 39:54.830
This must be the Dark Corridor
Sun just mentioned.

39:55.670 --> 39:57.200
It's pretty intimidating.

39:59.110 --> 40:00.320
I've taken some photos.

40:00.320 --> 40:00.960
Let's go.

40:07.070 --> 40:09.200
You're not afraid of the dark, are you?

40:10.120 --> 40:10.960
Of course not.

40:13.150 --> 40:13.880
Right.

40:14.350 --> 40:16.950
You were the one who saved me
back in Rongcheng.

40:18.560 --> 40:19.730
Don't walk so fast.

40:22.580 --> 40:24.180
Just admit it. You're afraid of the dark.
